### 查询用户总数（先跑这个，记住当前值）
GET http://localhost:8080/users/count

### 新增一个用户
POST http://localhost:8080/users?nickname=zhaoliu&schoolNo=2023004

### 查询所有用户
GET http://localhost:8080/users
### 修改存在的用户
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/3?nickname=xiaowang&credit=95

### 修改不存在的用户
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/9999?nickname=abc&credit=50
### 删除用户
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/4

### 查被删的用户
GET http://localhost:8080/users/4
### 发布商品
POST http://localhost:8080/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sellerId": 1,
  "title": "二手自行车",
  "description": "骑了一年，有轻微划痕",
  "price": 199.00,
  "categoryId": 2,
  "tradePlace": "3号楼",
  "conditionLevel": 8
}
### 列表（全部）
GET http://localhost:8080/items

### 列表（只看分类 2）
GET http://localhost:8080/items?categoryId=2

### 列表（不存在的分类 99）
GET http://localhost:8080/items?categoryId=99

### 总数（全部）
GET http://localhost:8080/items/count

### 总数（分类 2）
GET http://localhost:8080/items/count?categoryId=2
### 下架商品 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/items/1/status?status=3

### 看列表（应该空了）
GET http://localhost:8080/items

### 上架回来
PUT http://localhost:8080/items/1/status?status=0

### 再看列表（又回来了）
GET http://localhost:8080/items

### 传个非法值
PUT http://localhost:8080/items/1/status?status=99
###
PUT  http://localhost:8080/items/1/status?status=3
###
GET  http://localhost:8080/items/2
###
GET  http://localhost:8080/items/mine?sellerId=1
###
GET  http://localhost:8080/items/mine?sellerId=999
### ① 改商品 2
PUT http://localhost:8080/items/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "二手自行车（降价）", "description": "已换新刹车",
  "price": 150.00, "categoryId": 2, "tradePlace": "图书馆门口", "conditionLevel": 7 }

### ② 查详情确认
GET http://localhost:8080/items/2

### ③ 改不存在的商品
PUT http://localhost:8080/items/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "不存在", "price": 1.00, "categoryId": 1, "conditionLevel": 5 }
### ① 收藏商品 2（用户 1）
POST http://localhost:8080/favorites/2?userId=1

### ② 重复收藏同一个（应该报 4001 / 409）
POST http://localhost:8080/favorites/2?userId=1

### ③ 我的收藏列表 ← ★ 重点
GET http://localhost:8080/favorites?userId=1

### ④ 收藏总数
GET http://localhost:8080/favorites/count?userId=1

### ⑤ 取消收藏
DELETE http://localhost:8080/favorites/2?userId=1

### ⑥ 取消一个没收藏过的（应该报 4004）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/favorites/2?userId=1

### ⑦ 别人的收藏（应该空）
GET http://localhost:8080/favorites?userId=999
### ① 注册新用户
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nickname": "测试用户", "schoolNo": "2025001", "password": "123456" }

### ② 同一学号再注册
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nickname": "别人", "schoolNo": "2025001", "password": "abc123" }
### ① 正确密码
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "schoolNo": "2025001", "password": "123456" }

### ② 错误密码
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "schoolNo": "2025001", "password": "wrong" }
### ① 不带 token 访问商品列表
GET http://localhost:8080/items

### 登录拿 token（并自动存进变量）
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "schoolNo": "2025001", "password": "123456" }

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 带上 token 访问
GET http://localhost:8080/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
###
GET http://localhost:8080/items/mine?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
